    <label>Ostrogoths</label>
    <description>The eastern Goths of the Greutungi and the Amal royal house, whose great kingdom beyond the Black Sea broke under the Huns in 375. Most of them now live under Hunnic rule in Pannonia and ride to war beside their masters, but their kings dream of a realm of their own, and the Eastern Empire watches them warily. They fight with masses of archers and spearmen in dark blue, and above all with heavy cavalry: mailed nobles and lancers who charge with the long spear. They are Arian Christians like the other Goths.</description>
    <pawnSingular>Goth</pawnSingular>
    <pawnsPlural>Goths</pawnsPlural>
